{"content": "Following the plan, Mikasa maneuvers in front of the Female Titan in order to distract it; however, it attempts to attack Levi, who slices up its entire arm and stabs both his swords into its eyes. He then flies up, equipping a new pair of swords and continues cutting up his foe. Mikasa watches his speed in awe as the Female Titan does not even have time to harden its skin.\n\nLevi continues attacking from every direction, until his target reveals the nape of its neck. In spite of Levi's orders, Mikasa aims to kill the Female Titan, however Levi has to defend her, twisting his ankle painfully in the process. He then cuts through the Female Titan's mouth and grabs an unconscious and saliva-covered Eren, ordering Mikasa to retreat while also chastising her for putting her love for Eren over her orders. After short hesitation due to this comment, Mikasa follows him. Levi looks back and much to his surprise, he sees the Female Titan shedding tears.", "chunk_index": 1, "source_url": "https://attackontitan.fandom.com/wiki/The_Defeated:_The_57th_Exterior_Scouting_Mission,_Part_6", "source_title": "The Defeated: The 57th Exterior Scouting Mission, Part 6", "source_type": "episode", "episode_number": 22, "entity": null, "reveal_episode": 22, "embedding": [-0.03712671250104904, 0.07964055985212326, 0.027369752526283264, 0.005036780145019293, -0.02282816171646118, -0.038531381636857986, 0.13127653300762177, -0.00865932647138834, -0.037141744047403336, 0.09098115563392639, 0.06249019876122475, 0.02082807756960392, 0.0041459654457867146, 0.010978559032082558, -0.07127062976360321, -0.04709913209080696, 0.019383493810892105, -0.01997583732008934, 0.005316087510436773, 0.04686720669269562, 0.05648045986890793, -0.04130914807319641, 0.08766631782054901, 0.059290558099746704, 0.005423801951110363, 0.017827913165092468, 0.0570477694272995, -0.03482244163751602, -0.019899478182196617, -0.08883858472108841, -0.018360605463385582, 0.0028870045207440853, -0.05038021504878998